 Foundation Agent 003]], was used to contain [[Rassimov]]'s [[Amulets]] after he was arrested by the [[Huntik Foundation]]. Another was used by [[Lady S.]] to keep the [[Gold Scarabese]] separate from the others. {{source|Rassimov's Secret}}\n\n[[Category:Items]]","text":"A Reliquary was used by the Huntik Foundation to contain the Ring of Arc after Zhalia's Gareon delivered it to the Cathedral of Notre Dame. [Divide and Conquer]\n\nAnother Reliquary, held by Unnamed Foundation Agent 003, was used to contain Rassimov's Amulets after he was arrested by the Huntik Foundation. Another was used by Lady S. to keep the Gold Scarabese separate from the others. [Rassimov's Secret]"}],"full_text":"A Reliquary is a magical chest used to contain cursed artifacts and dangerous Amulets.\n\nHistory\n\nA Reliquary was used by the Huntik Foundation to contain the Ring of Arc after Zhalia's Gareon delivered it to the Cathedral of Notre Dame. [Divide and Conquer]\n\nAnother Reliquary, held by Unnamed Foundation Agent 003, was used to contain Rassimov's Amulets after he was arrested by the Huntik Foundation. Another was used by Lady S. to keep the Gold Scarabese separate from the others. [Rassimov's Secret]","raw_wikitext":"{{infobox item\n| image   = File:S2E47 Reliquary.png\n| type    = Magical chest\n| effects = Contains cursed artifacts\n| source  = \n| users   = [[Clements]]<br>[[Huntik Foundation]]<br>[[Lady S.]]<br>[[Unnamed Foundation Agent 003]]\n| first   = [[Divide and Conquer]]\n}}\nA '''Reliquary''' is a magical chest used to contain cursed artifacts and dangerous [[Amulets]].\n\n== History ==\nA Reliquary was used by the [[Huntik Foundation]] to contain the [[Ring of Arc]] after [[Zhalia Moon|Zhalia's]] [[Gareon]] delivered it to the [[Cathedral of Notre Dame]]. {{source|Divide and Conquer}}\n\nAnother Reliquary, held by [[Unnamed Foundation Agent 003]], was used to contain [[Rassimov]]'s [[Amulets]] after he was arrested by the [[Huntik Foundation]]. Another was used by [[Lady S.]] to keep the [[Gold Scarabese]] separate from the others. {{source|Rassimov's Secret}}\n\n[[Category:Items]]","categories":["Items"],"links":[{"target_id":"huntik:page:4654","status":"resolved","target_title":"Clements","label":"Clements","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Clements","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4654"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:1987","status":"resolved","target_title":"Huntik Foundation","label":"Huntik Foundation","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Huntik_Foundation","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1987"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:5429","status":"resolved","target_title":"Lady S.","label":"Lady S.","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Lady_S.","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A5429"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:26400","status":"resolved","target_title":"Unnamed Foundation Agent 003","label":"Unnamed Foundation Agent 003","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Unnamed_Foundation_Agent_003","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A26400"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2722","status":"resolved","target_title":"Divide and Conquer","label":"Divide and Conquer","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Divide_and_Conquer","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2722"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:1993","status":"resolved","target_title":"Amulets","label":"Amulets","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Amulets","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1993"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:1987","status":"resolved","target_title":"Huntik Foundation","label":"Huntik Foundation","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Huntik_Foundation","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1987"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2543","status":"resolved","target_title":"Ring of Arc","label":"Ring of Arc","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Ring_of_Arc","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2543"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2000","status":"resolved","target_title":"Zhalia Moon","label":"Zhalia's","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Zhalia_Moon","href":"#/e